notes:
Weapon is animated;
  • Upon being shown, the hammer's head emits green sonar waves twice, before spiraling a green ember down the helve then back up through it, igniting the hammer's head and engulfing it in flickering green flames.
  • After activation, the hammer's head flickers with green flames continuously, emits green sonar waves continuously, spirals a green ember down the helve then back up through it periodically, and shimmers periodically.
